0.91 0.95 0.99 rg 44 730.89 507.28 24 re f
0.075 0.376 0.729 rg 44 730.89 4 24 re f
0.075 0.376 0.729 rg BT /F2 12 Tf 56 737.89 Td (11. VIVA Q&A \(50 Important Questions & Simple Hinglish Answers\)) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 711.6899999999999 Td (Q1. Tumhare project ka naam aur purpose kya hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 699.29 Td (Ans: Project ka naam Car Rental Customer Registration hai. Ye ek Android app hai jo car rental) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 687.0899999999999 Td (customers ki personal aur contact details \(Name, Phone, DOB, Email, Address\) validate karke Cloud) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 674.8899999999999 Td (Firestore database mein save aur real-time manage karta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 657.4899999999998 Td (Q2. Paper register ya Excel ki jagah ye app kyu better hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 645.0899999999998 Td (Ans: Paper register ghum sakta hai aur galat phone/email rok nahi sakta. Hamara app 10-digit phone) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 632.8899999999998 Td (aur email validate karta hai, instant search deta hai, aur data Google Cloud mein safely backup rehta) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 620.6899999999997 Td (hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 603.2899999999996 Td (Q3. App mein kitni screens hain?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 590.8899999999996 Td (Ans: 3 main screens hain: Screen 1 \(AuthScreen\) Google Sign-In ke liye, Screen 2 \(CustomerFormScreen\)) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 578.6899999999996 Td (customer registration/editing ke liye, aur Screen 3 \(CustomerListScreen\) live customer cards aur) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 566.4899999999996 Td (search ke liye.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 549.0899999999995 Td (Q4. Minimum Android version kaunsa support karta hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 536.6899999999995 Td (Ans: minSdk = 24 \(Android 7.0 Nougat\) aur targetSdk = 36, matlab lagbhag 98%+ Android phones par) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 524.4899999999994 Td (smoothly chal jayega.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 507.0899999999994 Td (Q5. App ka theme aur UI design kaisa rakha hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 494.6899999999994 Td (Ans: Clean Car-Rental theme hai - Royal Blue \(#1360BA\) aur Crisp White \(#FFFFFF\), rounded Material 3) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 482.4899999999994 Td (cards, custom Car launcher icon, aur Plus Jakarta Sans + Inter fonts.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 465.0899999999994 Td (Q6. 'Add Dummy Data' button kyu banaya hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 452.6899999999994 Td (Ans: Demo aur testing fast karne ke liye. Ek click mein 5 realistic Indian customers \(Aarav Sharma,) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 440.4899999999994 Td (Priya Patel, Rohan Deshmukh, Ananya Iyer, Vikram Malhotra\) Firestore WriteBatch se insert ho jate) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 428.2899999999994 Td (hain.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 410.8899999999994 Td (Q7. Kya app tablet ya bade screen par bhi achha dikhta hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 398.4899999999994 Td (Ans: Haan, MainActivity.kt mein BoxWithConstraints use kiya hai - compact phone \(< 600dp\) par bottom) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 386.2899999999994 Td (NavigationBar dikhta hai aur tablet \(>= 600dp\) par side NavigationRail.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 368.8899999999994 Td (Q8. Kya customer data edit aur delete kar sakte hain?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 356.4899999999994 Td (Ans: Haan, full CRUD support hai. Har card par Edit icon \(form prefill karke update karta hai\) aur) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 344.2899999999994 Td (Delete icon \(AlertDialog confirmation ke baad Firestore se delete karta hai\) diya hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 326.8899999999994 Td (Q9. Search kaise kaam karta hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 314.4899999999994 Td (Ans: CustomerListScreen mein search query live Firestore list par in-memory filter lagati hai - name,) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 302.2899999999994 Td (phone, email ya address kisi se bhi turant search hota hai bina extra DB reads kharch kiye.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 284.8899999999994 Td (Q10. Internet permission kahaan di hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 272.4899999999994 Td (Ans: app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml mein INTERNET aur ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE permissions declare ki) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 260.2899999999994 Td (hain.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 242.88999999999942 Td (Q11. DBMS kya hota hai aur tumne kaunsa DBMS use kiya?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 230.4899999999994 Td (Ans: DBMS \(Database Management System\) software hota hai jo data ko structured tarike se store,) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 218.28999999999942 Td (retrieve, update aur secure karta hai. Humne Cloud Firestore use kiya hai, jo Google ka NoSQL cloud) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 206.08999999999943 Td (DBMS hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 188.68999999999946 Td (Q12. SQL aur NoSQL mein main difference kya hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 176.28999999999945 Td (Ans: SQL relational tables \(rows/columns\) aur fixed schema use karta hai \(jaise MySQL\). NoSQL) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 164.08999999999946 Td (\(Firestore\) collections aur JSON-like documents use karta hai, schema flexible hota hai aur cloud) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 151.88999999999947 Td (scaling easy hoti hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 134.4899999999995 Td (Q13. Firestore mein Collection, Document aur Field kya hote hain?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 122.08999999999949 Td (Ans: Collection SQL ki table jaisa hai \(customers\), Document ek row/record jaisa hai \(ek customer\),) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 109.88999999999949 Td (aur Field ek column jaisa hai \(name, phone, dob, email, address\).) Tj ET
