0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 714.0899999999998 Td (Ans: CRUD matlab Create, Read, Update, Delete. CustomerRepository.kt mein: Create =) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 701.8899999999998 Td (addCustomer\(\)/addDummyCustomers\(\), Read = observeCustomers\(\), Update = updateCustomer\(\), Delete =) Tj ET
