0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 659.8899999999996 Td (Ans: Normalization SQL databases mein JOIN ke saath redundancy kam karne ke liye hoti hai. Firestore) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 647.6899999999996 Td (NoSQL hai jahan JOIN nahi hota, isliye fast reads ke liye customer ke saare fields ek document mein) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 635.4899999999996 Td (\(denormalized\) rakhe hain.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 618.0899999999995 Td (Q17. Data Integrity kaise maintain ki hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 605.6899999999995 Td (Ans: Do layers par: client-side CustomerViewModel + CustomerRepository validation \(10-digit phone,) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 593.4899999999994 Td (email regex, non-empty\), aur server-side firestore.rules \(isValidCustomer\) jo galat data database) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 581.2899999999994 Td (level par hi reject kar deta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 563.8899999999993 Td (Q18. FieldValue.serverTimestamp\(\) kyu use kiya, System.currentTimeMillis\(\) kyu nahi?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 551.4899999999993 Td (Ans: Phone ka local time galat ho sakta hai ya user badal sakta hai. FieldValue.serverTimestamp\(\)) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 539.2899999999993 Td (Google server ka accurate time set karta hai jo security rules \(createdAt <= request.time\) ke saath) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 527.0899999999992 Td (consistent rehta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 509.6899999999992 Td (Q19. WriteBatch kya hota hai aur ACID se kaise juda hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 497.28999999999917 Td (Ans: db.batch\(\) multiple writes ko ek Atomic unit bana deta hai \(addDummyCustomers\(\) mein 5) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 485.0899999999992 Td (documents\). Ya toh saare 5 customer ek saath save honge, ya error aane par ek bhi nahi - database) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 472.8899999999992 Td (consistent rehta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 455.4899999999992 Td (Q20. Indexing Firestore mein kaise hoti hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 443.0899999999992 Td (Ans: Firestore har field par automatically single-field index banata hai, isliye) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 430.8899999999992 Td (.whereEqualTo\('userId', uid\) fast chalta hai. Sorting client-side ki hai taaki extra composite index) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 418.6899999999992 Td (error na aaye.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 401.2899999999992 Td (Q21. Real-Time Sync kaise kaam karta hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 388.8899999999992 Td (Ans: Humne .snapshots\(\) Flow use kiya hai jo Firestore par real-time listener attach karta hai. Jab) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 376.6899999999992 Td (bhi data badalta hai, server automatically updated snapshot app ko push kar deta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 359.2899999999992 Td (Q22. Offline mein app kholein toh kya hoga?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 346.8899999999992 Td (Ans: Cloud Firestore mein local persistence cache by default on hota hai, isliye pehle se load kiye) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 334.6899999999992 Td (hue customers offline bhi dikh sakte hain aur internet aate hi sync ho jate hain.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 317.2899999999992 Td (Q23. createdAt immutable kyu rakha hai?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 304.8899999999992 Td (Ans: Registration time historical audit field hai. Update par sirf editable fields aur updatedAt) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 292.6899999999992 Td (badalte hain; firestore.rules enforce karta hai incoming\(\).createdAt == existing\(\).createdAt.) Tj ET
