0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 262.8899999999992 Td (Ans: One-to-Many \(1 : N\) - ek authenticated User multiple Customer documents register aur manage kar) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 250.6899999999992 Td (sakta hai.) Tj ET
