0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 220.88999999999922 Td (Ans: Ye Firebase config file hai jisme project ID, package name, OAuth Web Client ID, aur SHA-1 hash) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 208.68999999999923 Td (hota hai. Gradle build ke time isse padhkar app ko Firebase backend se connect karta hai.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 191.28999999999925 Td (Q26. Firebase BoM \(Bill of Materials\) kyu use kiya?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 178.88999999999925 Td (Ans: platform\(libs.firebase.bom\) \(version 35.1.0\) saari Firebase libraries \(firebase-auth,) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 166.68999999999926 Td (firebase-firestore\) ke compatible versions auto-manage karta hai taaki version conflict na ho.) Tj ET
0.075 0.30 0.60 rg BT /F2 9.2 Tf 44 149.28999999999928 Td (Q27. Google Sign-In ke liye kaunsi library use hui?) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 136.88999999999928 Td (Ans: Latest Jetpack Credential Manager \(androidx.credentials 1.5.0\) aur GoogleId) Tj ET
