0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 768.29 Td (Ans: Test mode \(allow read, write: if true\) insecure hota hai - koi bhi internet se customer ke phone) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 756.0899999999999 Td (aur address chura sakta hai. Humne zero-trust owner-only rules lagaye hain.) Tj ET
