0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 726.2899999999998 Td (Ans: Firestore rules data ko filter nahi karte, balki query ko allow ya reject karte hain. Kyunki) Tj ET
0.14 0.18 0.24 rg BT /F1 9.0 Tf 52 714.0899999999998 Td (rule existing\(\).userId == request.auth.uid check karta hai, client query mein .whereEqualTo\('userId',) Tj ET
